<translation id="6398664274442544385">ደህንነቱ የተጠበቀ የAlacrium ገፅ እየተመለከቱ ነው</translation>
<translation id="2028209743487670346">የAlacrium ዓርማ</translation>
<translation id="7690933224612299375">Alacrium በ<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CHROMIUM" />Chromium<ph name="END_LINK_CHROMIUM" />  ክፍት ምንጭ ፕሮጀክት እና በሌላ <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_OSS" />ክፍት ምንጭ ሶፍትዌር<ph name="END_LINK_OSS" /> እውን ሊሆን ችሏል።</translation>
